Cell["\<\
The event {1, 3} is reached by light sent at arc length 2 and echoed back at \
4.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8668f4af-6b66-4b7e-bc16-aed13a29dc4c"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"BondiRadarCoordinates", "[", 
  RowBox[{"{", 
   RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"5bb8499f-f63e-4dca-8732-d6217566d0d6"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarTime\"\>", "\[Rule]", "3"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarDistance\"\>", "\[Rule]", "1"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"EmitArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", "2"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"ReturnArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", "4"}]}], 
  "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]= ",ExpressionUUID->"78060149-0db9-4970-9b0a-7415a2670a3f"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "At the light angle \[Pi]/3 the radar time is the same and the radar \
distance shrinks by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["cot",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", "\[CurlyPhi]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "de8f1868-756f-46a9-916f-20889e6bab6c"],
 "."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"e0ff174d-a5e3-4e32-8a88-59eced5b3027"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"BondiRadarCoordinates", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "3"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Pi", "/", "3"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"1756e134-e197-475a-a06b-23a4246918d7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"\[LeftAssociation]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarTime\"\>", "\[Rule]", "3"}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"RadarDistance\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    FractionBox["1", 
     SqrtBox["3"]]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"EmitArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"3", "-", 
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["3"]]}]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{"\<\"ReturnArcLength\"\>", "\[Rule]", 
    RowBox[{"3", "+", 
     FractionBox["1", 
      SqrtBox["3"]]}]}]}], "\[RightAssociation]"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[2]= ",ExpressionUUID->"8f36606b-6d7e-4648-ac20-b27372d8c253"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]],

